---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
import { offerCopy } from '../config/offers';
const title = 'Terms';
const description = 'The terms behind the published prices and the diagnostic guarantee at Get Smart AI. Plain language, no fine print traps.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} active={undefined}>
  <section aria-labelledby="t-h">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width: 720px;">
      <p class="kicker" data-in>Terms</p>
      <h1 class="sec-title" id="t-h" data-in>The terms, in plain language</h1>
      <div class="prose" data-in style="margin-top: 24px;">
        <p class="lead">Every price on this site is a real starting point, and the guarantee below is a commitment, not a slogan.</p>

        <h2>The diagnostic guarantee</h2>
        <p>{offerCopy.guaranteeFull}</p>
        <p>In practice: after the diagnostic is delivered, you have 30 days to decide whether it was worth the fee. If you decide it was not, the invoice is voided and I do not ask you to justify it. If you go ahead with a build within 90 days, the $750 is subtracted from that build's price.</p>

        <h2>About the prices</h2>
        <p>Prices shown as a range or with "from" are starting points. The final number is fixed and agreed in writing after the diagnostic, based on the scope we define together. There are no hidden fees. Nothing is recurring: the only optional monthly item is office hours, and only if you ask for them.</p>

        <h2>What you own</h2>
        <p>When a build is delivered, the code and accounts are yours. There is no monthly fee to keep it running and no lock-in. If we ever part ways, you get a written handoff and a 30-day transition.</p>

        <h2>Who you are contracting with</h2>
        <p>All engagements are with {site.dba}, {site.legalLocation}. A written agreement covers the scope, price, and any data handling before work begins.</p>

        <p class="foot__meta">{site.dba} · {site.legalLocation}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
